WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.220
- In the last month since "SNL" Jason

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.470
has been traveling a lot
and sending us videos,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.850
so let's see a few.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.100
- I'm in my favorite place in London.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.060
I'm coming to you soon.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.790
I can't wait to see you. (smacking lips)

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.023
Kelly Clarkson!

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.510
Mama, I'm gonna see you soon.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.253
Right now I'm in Shanghai!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.941
Damn it look good.

00:00:19.941 --> 00:00:23.790
I'm in Beijing right now,
but it can take me a while.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.640
I got a little bit of a walk,
so I'll see you soon, baby!

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:29.283
(audience laughing and cheering)

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:30.770
(Kelly clapping)

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.220
- That was awesome.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.360
I think we're so blessed

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.100
because in the entertainment industry,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.750
you get to travel to so many cool places.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.700
What's one of your favorite
places you've been?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.740
- That's pretty amazing
to be on The Great Wall.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.570
- [Kelly] I know, I've
always wanted to do it.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:46.740
- I've had a couple
opportunities, but that was it.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.610
That was phenomenal

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.630
and then I've never been on top

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.393
of that building looking at Shanghai.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.920
China was pretty epic.
- Yeah.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.480
- It's been two weeks
we've been traveling,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.700
Brazil, China, I have no
idea where I'm at right now.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.539
- You have no idea...
(audience laughing)

00:00:57.539 --> 00:00:58.372
Look, I can tell by your voice-

00:00:58.372 --> 00:00:59.912
- The whole time I'm
like, "Kelly Clarkson!"

00:00:59.912 --> 00:01:02.009
(audience laughing)
You know why?

00:01:02.009 --> 00:01:05.473
(audience applauding)

00:01:05.473 --> 00:01:07.336
You're the finish line.

00:01:07.336 --> 00:01:08.169
- I'm your last?

00:01:08.169 --> 00:01:09.002
- You're the finish line.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.854
- Oh!
- Kelly Clarkson, help me!

00:01:11.854 --> 00:01:13.721
- No, I know that promo schedule

00:01:13.721 --> 00:01:15.480
'cause I could tell by your
voice when you first spoke,

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.625
I was like, "Oh, brother is tired."

00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:18.780
(audience laughing)
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.976
You've got that deep thing
that happens when you wake up.

00:01:20.976 --> 00:01:21.908
- It's past tired.

00:01:21.908 --> 00:01:23.082
I don't even know what it is.

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:23.915
- You know what?

00:01:23.915 --> 00:01:24.810
Then it gets fun, it gets silly

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.670
and you just start laughing
and crying hysterically

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.380
at the same time.
- Yes, yup.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.813
- Well, we'll enjoy this moment.

00:01:29.813 --> 00:01:31.459
(audience laughing)

00:01:31.459 --> 00:01:33.360
You travel with a guitar and a speaker.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.580
Do you busk everywhere?

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:38.250
What do you do there? (laughing)

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.750
- Well, I'm kind of like you.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.769
- Okay, then you must be nuts.

00:01:41.769 --> 00:01:42.684
(audience laughing)
- Yeah.

00:01:42.684 --> 00:01:44.171
- Yeah.
- There's a lot going on-

00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:45.004
- Me too.
- So I feel like it just,

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.920
it helps me sit still and be quiet.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.110
So it's nice to have
something that just calms me

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.300
so the music helps and then,
obviously, playing guitar

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.900
just helps my creativity, so I can just-

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.340
- [Kelly] No, I'm ADHD, I have to do that.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.773
- Yeah, so guitar just helps me.

